{"2057790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loop", "steam_appid": 2057790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2716310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras/9d581a5e85417706761e131e08aed165.poster.avif?t=1782731764\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras/9d581a5e85417706761e131e08aed165.webm?t=1782731764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras/9d581a5e85417706761e131e08aed165.mp4?t=1782731764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Discover Loop - A relaxing contemplative puzzler; where you and your companion travel through a mysterious, ethereal temple.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the realm's balance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this cooperative Journey, you will traverse many riddles and face the ultimate enigma: <i>can the endless loop be broken?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beautiful &amp; Contemplative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loop </strong> will help you relax within beautiful and varied environments. The gameplay is centered in playing along with a Spirit which acts both as a reliable guide through the temple and as a faithful companion to discover the world with. The game narrative will take you through rich environments and unique and creative puzzles. The story is beautifully told without any dialogue, everything is visual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful and unique art-style, beautiful minimalism focused on shapes, lighting and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play along a Mentor companion who guides you through the temple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive and relaxing puzzles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 contemplative unique levels during this journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enigmatic narrative within varied Ambients &amp; Rich Environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgettable and immersive original soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you are looking forward to a relaxing experience, where you can observe beautiful scenery, and cooperate while solving colorful minimalist puzzles, then the world of Loop awaits you.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras/e1ba2c9252a7c011cf89697f3c221948.avif?t=1782731764\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras_big/e1ba2c9252a7c011cf89697f3c221948.avif?t=1782731764 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras/9d581a5e85417706761e131e08aed165.poster.avif?t=1782731764\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras/9d581a5e85417706761e131e08aed165.webm?t=1782731764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057790/extras/9d581a5e85417706761e131e08aed165.mp4?t=1782731764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Discover Loop - A relaxing contemplati